{"id":"f5ba362a191833f5","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-kripke-semantics-example.md","title":"Kripke Semantics Example","display":"ex-kripke-semantics-example — Kripke Semantics Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-kripke-semantics-example","aliases":["89-ex-kripke-semantics-example"],"display":"ex-kripke-semantics-example — Kripke Semantics Example","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-kripke-semantics-example"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-kripke-semantics-example</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-kripke-semantics-example — Kripke Semantics Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{w_1,w_2\\}\">\\(W=\\{w_1,w_2\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(w_1,w_2)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(w_1,w_2)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M},w_1\\models\\Box p\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M},w_2\\models p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M},w_1\\models\\Box p\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M},w_2\\models p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span> : Kripke模型 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_1 R w_2\">\\(w_1 R w_2\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_1\">\\(w_1\\)</span>可达<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_2\">\\(w_2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_2\">\\(w_2\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_1\">\\(w_1\\)</span> 唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-后继，因此该等价直接展开自\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 子句；无需假定模型属于 GL。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}$ : Kripke模型 (see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$w_2$ 是 $w_1$ 唯一的 $R$-后继，因此该等价直接展开自\n[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]] 的 $\\Box$ 子句；无需假定模型属于 GL。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{w_1,w_2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{(w_1,w_2)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}semantics\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{M},w_1\\models\\Box p\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M},w_2\\models p.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"w_1 R w_2","display":false},{"tex":"w_1","display":false},{"tex":"w_2","display":false},{"tex":"w_2","display":false},{"tex":"w_1","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":946,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-581","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-ex-kripke-semantics-example]]"}],"outgoing":["ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}